WEBVTT

14:05.287 --> 14:07.456
- It's so skinny.
- So are you.

14:08.791 --> 14:10.626
I had the blacksmith
make it for you special.

14:10.751 --> 14:11.961
It won't hack a man's head off,

14:12.086 --> 14:13.963
but it can poke him full of holes
if you're quick enough.

14:14.088 --> 14:16.757
- I can be quick.
- You'll have to work at it every day.

14:18.259 --> 14:19.677
How does it feel?

14:20.594 --> 14:22.888
Do you like the balance?

14:23.013 --> 14:24.515
I think so.

14:25.975 --> 14:28.394
First lesson - stick them with the pointy end.

14:28.519 --> 14:30.396
I know which end to use.
